Z||000014||Archie||06-18-2000||01:35 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Sillhouette.com:<BR><B>You know !!<P>I just returned from the Detroit Fiero show. There I saw a lot of cool stuff and a lot of cunny stuff.  Anyways everyone there knew Archie and the name got tossed around however some of the more seasoned and experienced drivers were not impressed with Archies work at all.  They would not say why just advised me to stay away from him.  Any of you know why that would be?<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That's strange, I've been involved in Fieros for more than 14 years.  So, I guess that would make me one of the "more seasoned and experienced".  In fact I know that there were no Fiero suppliers at that show that have been around longer than I have.  Strange how these "more seasoned and experienced drivers" never are mentioned by name, or quoted as to exactly what they said.  Yet, the name of the guy they are trashing (or you say they are trashing) never seems to be forgotten.  Heck, you're business has been around for what? Maybe a year?  Does it enhance your business of selling little headlights and steering wheels to advance stories from "un-named sources"?<P>You don't know me, you have not done business with me. You are trying to be in the Fiero business, why would you post this type of message without naming your sources?<P>Archie<P>||||reg||1
