Z||000042||Cliff Pennock||06-18-2000||08:02 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Archie:<BR><I>Now I remember why I've been a member for 6 months and have not said anything and only rarely read any of this stuff.<P>Archie</I><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Don't attack the forum, Archie. This is the best place on the internet for Fiero owners to get information - without any hidden agenda, without any commercial background. Most of the time the people here are very reasonable and helpful and flamewars have been very rare indeed. So don't come here and make remarks like <I><B>"Yep, you guys here have a lot of class"</B></I> and <I><B>"I wonder why suppliers tend not to get active in these groups"</B></I>. If you thought forums like these are a waste of time, you shouldn't have created one using PFF as an example. I had always thought that was a dumb idea. You could've just linked to this forum (with over a thousand members now and over 600 members at that time) but instead you saw PFF was a huge success and was emptying TechNet - and you had to create your own.<P>I'm very sorry if I'm a bit harsh - but I get tremendously p'ed off when someone (no matter who) attacks my members or my forum in general. I'm very protective about both.||||reg||1
Z||000043||Fret Naught||06-18-2000||10:18 PM||||Man I hate flame wars, Haze you were doing the right thing, Now, Anybody Seen any good movies lately?||||reg||9
