Z||000045||Archie||06-18-2000||11:24 PM||||This is long and is the last message I'll post to this thread.<P>First off, I don't think I was attacking the forum.  You must admit that some of the responses we've seen in this thread have <BR>been just like we used to see on the Fiero-list.  You've read the posts & you know what I'm talking about.<P>YOU SAID:<BR>&gt; This is the best place on the internet for  Fiero owners to get information - without any hidden agenda, <P>Well it could be, As I told you in the letter I sent you earlier today. I told you I liked the format, and with the Profile section it <BR>at least makes people a little accountable for what they say. If there is no "hidden agenda" then what were your members <BR>doing when they used this subject thread to personally attack me and TechNet?  How can I have a "hidden agenda" when there were 14 posts to this thread before I ever posted? And my posts were only responses to information that others had brought up. <P>YOU SAID:<BR>&gt; without any commercial background.<P>I'll take this as a statement of Forum policy.  So this forum is only open to those that would talk about a commercial venture and not to those who would be actually involved in that commercial venture.<P>YOU SAY:<BR>Most of the time the people here are very reasonable ...ETC.<P>Maybe they are, but the one's that came out to attack me when I hadn't even made a post have like I said "a lot of class". My statement "Yep, you guys here have a lot of class" was directed at people who would respond to an intellegent conversation by saying "Bite Me." or "BLAH BLAH BLAH". It was not directed at the membership in general.  But if I had to make a judgement on this forum by the way a few of it's members responded in this thread then I would have no problem figuring out "why suppliers tend not to get active in these groups".<P>YOU SAID:<BR>you shouldn't have created one using PFF as an example. I had always thought that was a dumb idea. <P>Ok, Now we are starting to get to the subject of your agenda.<P>YOU SAID:<BR>You could've just linked to this forum (with over a thousand members now and over 600 members at that time) but instead you saw PFF was a huge success and was emptying TechNet - and you had to create your own.<P>Actually you have this one all wrong. as of the day before we setup the BB on my site, I had never heard of this type of format, had I seen your BB. When we moved to our current Web Site Server this format was a free thing that came with the hosting thing.  I didn't even know it was there and what it was. One of my people told me it was free and that it was similar to PFF.  At that time I'd never heard of PFF (or I'd have joined earlier). He sent me a link for PFF and I joined the same day.  When we switched to the new host we had 580 members on TechNet. As of right now TechNet has 665 members. So the part of your story about emptying TechNet is incorrect. I belong to every Fiero group I can find and I'm sure there is room for even more groups.  I'm sure that more than 75% of your (or my) members also belong to other groups. I'm sorry that my little Bulletin Board caused you to carry so much anger all this time.  You should have written and expressed yourself right away. At that time a BB on my site just looked like a good place where the guys could discuss Woofers and Sex in Fieros.  My offer that I made in this mornings EMail still stands. (even though I made this offer before all the junk I saw posted today) If someone shows me how to do it, I'll refer the people using my BB to yours.<P>If you want to make this a competition for number of members between TechNet and PFF. Like a Us vs Them thing, you go right ahead and take off running, I'm not going to be running that race.  Running TechNet is a thankless job. Just think about it, everytime someone gets automatically removed for bounces. Or everytime someone feels the list slighted them, they can blame it on me or my business. Every once in a while someone thanks me for info they got from the list, but that's the only positive thing for a business owning and participating in a list.  So if you think we need to be in some kind of competition you go right ahead. I think TechNet works best with a membership between 550 & 600.  Whenever we get over 600 it seems the quality of the posts goes down.<P>I'm very sorry if this seems a bit harsh, but I didn't know you were so angry at me & I didn't know we were in some kind of competition with each other.<P>A lot of list members talk about all Fiero owners getting together and getting along, how can that happen when the same people attack new members when they make their first post?  How can that happen when the list owners don't make it clear to thier members that civility is expected?<P>I would like to know why everyone who owns one of the Fiero lists or BB's or Chats tries to segment our Fiero hobby by discouraging members from belonging to more than one group.<P>Thanks for making me feel welcome here.<P>I would like to thank Haze_Performance for giving me a "Heads-up" on a bad situation, you are a gentleman and a scholar.<P>Now that I've spent quite some time on this last message, I expect that someone will respond with a firm "Bite Me."<P>Archie<BR>                 ||||reg||1
Z||000046||cobra427||06-18-2000||11:52 PM||||Hey Archie,<BR>You won't get a "Bite  me " from me. I met you at Carlisle this year and I think you're a class guy. If I were in your position and was attacked as you so often are, I would react in the same manner.  Thumbs up to you Archie.  <P>    Cooter......MM shame on you. Stimpy, you're a trouble maker.Get real will ya!<P><BR>cobra||||reg||1
Z||000047||Terrybogin||06-18-2000||11:58 PM||||Archie, I'd hate to disappoint you, so:<BR>First- Bite Me! Hey, you asked for it.<P>Second- If you were half as intelligent as you like to think you are, you might almost have a clue. <P>I have never made a personal attack on anyone on this forum until now. Now, your childish remarks have been met with remarks just as childish. You were right, this is like high school all over again. Except now, you cant be the bully- Poor Baby!||||reg||1
Z||000048||stimpy||06-19-2000||12:16 AM||||Hey Cobra...WTF did I do?!<P>I KNEW I couldn't make it through a week without pissing someone off! <P>"Get real"... whatever. Why don't you elaborate? My email is right up there on my profile. ||||reg||11
