Z||000051||frontal lobe||06-19-2000||12:59 AM||||In NO WAY am I taking sides here.  I am FOR all my Fiero friends AND Archie.  He has given Fiero owners an excellent option for improving their Fieros.  I am glad for that.  Yes, he makes some profit from that.  What is wrong with that?  He also has strong opinions and can be forceful in expressing them.  Fine.  He may think regarding Fieros he is always right (I don't know that he does, I said MAY).  Well, I'm fine with that,too.  He has confidence in the knowledge he has obtained over the past 16 or so years.  That may rub some people the wrong way, but IF he wrongly does (I'm not saying he does, but IF), I would be willing to cut him some slack because of all the value he has brought to the enhancement of Fieros.  <P>To my friends on the forum, I would just ASK you to consider the total body of his work and life around Fieros, and not just a few incidents.<P>To Archie, I would just ASK you to consider the total body of this forum, and not this one thread.  I know that is tough when it gets off so much on the wrong foot.  <P>Respectfully to all, Dan||||reg||1
