Z||000054||Cliff Pennock||06-19-2000||05:22 AM||||Oh Archie. I couldn't care less about your forum or technet. I couldn't care less if your forum had a million members and mine dropped to one. If you would have read any of my messages in the past 1.5 year you would have known that (as my members do).<P>And don't tell me PFF wasn't used as an example. Check this message on your own forum: <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/ubb/Forum3/HTML/000001.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/ubb/Forum3/HTML/000001.html</A>  (I'll quote it for you: "I really like how Cliff's message board turned out. That's why I suggested to put this up. If Archie's message board turns out as successful as Cliff's, we'll end up purchasing the full version of Ultimate Bulletin Board.")<P>That didn't anger me - I just thought it was a dumb idea. But I have never, ever said anything negative about you, your site, or your forum. I have even pointed out your site to my members a couple of times.<P>This isn't a competition thing and I have no idea why you turned my response to you into one. As I'm equally clueless why you chose to trash forums like these in general with your remarks.<P>As for your letter: I haven't received an email (I suppose you are talking about an email) on any of my email addresses. I'll close this thread in a bit but will give others the opportunity to put in their final word.||||reg||1
