Z||000057||lennyb4||06-19-2000||08:27 AM||||Oh crap!!! Now do you see what your making me do?? I have tried hard to avoid this issue BUT i cant take it anymore.This is with out a doupt the most informative and interesting place on the net w/the most friendly and informative people around. Now archie you stated that cliff should let his members know that civility is required? Did you ever stop to think that the reason this board is such a success is because cliff allows the members to say what we really feel and truely think with out having to be worried about being kicked off or something stupid like that? When we flame each other or disagree with each other its all human nature. There are some people on this forum who the first time we met they were flaming me and now i think of them as friends. I have never had any buisness dealings with you (my duck runs just toooo good) but that doesnt mean i wouldnt. BUT i have to agree with cliff and say that i to feel you are slightly attacking the forum and its members. I think of these people as a distant family of sorts (might be disfunctional, but who the hell wants normal anyways). So lets just get over it and back to the important issues at hand ( fieros, ricers, and tree freshners....    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  ) <P>[This message has been edited by lennyb4 (edited 06-19-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by lennyb4 (edited 06-19-2000).]||||reg||6
Z||000058||Archie||06-19-2000||08:48 AM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by Cliff Pennock:<BR>. Check this message on your own forum: <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/ubb/Forum3/HTML/000001.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/ubb/Forum3/HTML/000001.html</A>  (I'll quote it for you: "I really like how Cliff's message board turned out. That's why I suggested to put this up. If Archie's message board turns out as successful as Cliff's, we'll end up purchasing the full version of Ultimate Bulletin Board.")<P>That didn't anger me  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  ) <P>It does anger me that you just attributed a quote to me that I DIDN'T WRITE!!!!! What the heck is the matter with you?  I expect that some list members mis-read or mis quote the words of others, but we should expect a list owner to be able to read and understand what he reads & writes. Go back and re-read that thread.<P>How did I get the impression that you thought we were in competition? Maybe I got it from what you said in your post on 06-18-2000 08:02 PM where you spend a lot of words comparing list membership numbers.<P>Anyone that goes back and re-reads your posts and my posts will see that you are all wet.<P>As for my EMail to you, I sent it from my shop PC, so a copy of it is on that machine. But not to worry, after your latest responce that offer is withdrawn.<P>Archie||||reg||1
Z||000059||Cliff Pennock||06-19-2000||09:22 AM||||Jezus Archie - where did I ever say you wrote that??? I said your forum was made after the example set by PFF. And it's clearly stated so on your forum.<P><I>&gt; Anyone that goes back and re-reads your<BR>&gt; posts and my posts will see that you are all wet.<BR>&gt;<BR>&gt;As for my EMail to you, I sent it from my<BR>&gt; shop PC, so a copy of it is on that machine.<BR>&gt; But not to worry, after your latest responce that offer is withdrawn.<BR></I><P>I'd never thought I would say that to a visitor of my forum but: <B>you really need to grow up</B>. You are desperately trying to twist your words, my words and those of others to make your wrongs rights. You are unbelievable. I used to have a lot of respect for you - even though I had never met you - but now you have shown to be very immature, resolving to personal attacks. You are not worth my time, bandwidth or serverspace.<P>Case closed.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000060||UFO!||06-19-2000||09:28 AM||||Not to feed the fire...<P>But I was the one who made the post about the UBB we added to the Archie's site. At the time, the Listserv provider for Technet was bought out. Archie and I we undecided on what to do. We could keep the Technet where it is, or maybe try to start up a bulletin board system, like yours Cliff. It was never ment to "compete" (that seems to be an issue here) with PFF. It was more of a "trial" to see what people would like better in Technet case. We could have basically said, "Sorry, we're closing Technet. I suggest going to <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl." TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl.</A>  Cliff Pennock has set up a very nice Fiero Forum that is very active." But Archie and I knew that there were many people who didn't like the "moderation" over here. Not a flame Cliff, just the way things are over here.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> One person in the thread said that it's the freedom to post what you want. Personally I think that's great. But I know several people on the Technet that enjoy the moderation and there are some that don't.<P>I really dont think Archie ment to come in here and "bash" PFF. Yes, he has a short fuse sometimes. Yes, he likes to speak his mind. But when someone posts a message title, "If you know Archie please read this!!!", basically that is an invitation for Archie to come read this. Then when he reads other people's posts flaming him, of course he will answer back. <P>Like I said, I didn't mean to "feed the fire." I just wanted to clear up that comment on the other board.<P>Happy Fieroing  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>--Mike||||reg||1
